{"timestamp":"2026-08-26T05:50:40.497Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a03c9e-e171-7a32-8516-fa1451e5d18d","call_id":"call_PXZjfKIYooFxO7L4ByqaiJgF","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.1 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 19693)\nTotal output lines: 1669\n\n### guide\n# Offline 실행 가이드\n\n`offline_offload_kvweight.py`는 한 process에서 정답, runtime route,\ngenerated token과 TTFT/TPOT를 확인하는 진입점이다. 네 기능 조합 전체는\n[기능 조합 테스트](EXPERIMENT_GUIDE.md), engine 준비와 step 내부 순서는\n[Inference 수행 흐름](INFERENCE_FLOW.md)을 사용한다.\n\n| 방식 | Process/환경 | 자동 판정 |\n|---|---|---|\n| Feature matrix | cell마다 fresh process, 주요 `TIERED_SERVE_*` 정리 | residency, route, semantic answer, optional exact token |\n| 수동 offline | 현재 shell 상속, 임의 config/backend 가능 | semantic answer와 token dump; route는 log에서 확인 |\n\n여러 `--ts-configs`를 한 번에 주면 같은 engine을 reconfigure한다. 독립적인\nA/B에는 config마다 fresh process를 사용한다.\n\n모든 명령은 저장소 루트에서 실행한다.\n\n```bash\ncd /root/projects/tiered-serve\n```\n\n## 0. LD_PRELOAD: CPython frame-stack mmap/munmap 제거\n\nCPython 3.12은 interpreter frame data-stack을 16 KiB 단위로\n`mmap(MAP_ANONYMOUS)`/`munmap`으로 할당·해제한다. vLLM V1의 깊은\nper-piece call chain이 이 경계를 반복적으로 넘어 nsys에서 step당\n수천 회의 `mmap64`/`munmap`을 발생시킨다.\n\n`etc/stack_pool.so`는 `mmap64`/`munmap`을 가로채서 16 KiB chunk를\nfree-list pool로 재사용한다. 반환 시 `memset`으로 zeroing하여\n`MAP_ANONYMOUS`의 zeroed-page 계약을 보존한다.\n\n**모든 실행 명령에 `LD_PRELOAD`를 붙인다.**\n\n```bash\nLD_PRELOAD=/root/projects/tiered-serve/etc/stack_pool.so\n```\n\n`.so` 빌드 방법은 [구조 가이드의 Tips](LANDING_GUIDE.md#6-tips)를\n참고한다.\n\n## 1. 실행 전 확인\n\n[구조 가이드의 preflight](LANDING_GUIDE.md#1-지원-범위와-workspace)를 먼저\n통과해야 한다. 새 shell을 사용하고 이전 실험의 KV codec/layout 설정을\n물려받지 않도록 다음 값을 비운다.\n\n```bash\nunset TIERED_SERVE_KV_COMP_PRODUCER\nunset TIERED_SERVE_KV_BLOB_STRIDE\nunset TIERED_SERVE_KV_BLOB_SLACK\nunset TIERED_SERVE_KV_COMP_PREFILL_LOAD\nunset TIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_SIZE_GB\n```\n\nCorrectness 예제는 고정 prompt로 2 tokens를 만들고 `Paris`를 semantic\noracle로 사용한다. Batch 1 full-block KV compression은 logical `D=16`,\ntail `S=1`, physical offset `D+S=17`이므로 dedicated-row request는 17,\nplanner override는 1025를 사용한다.\n\n## 2. 네 기능을 켠 correctness 실행\n\n### 2.1 8B\n\n```bash\nTIERED_SERVE_NUM_WEIGHT_HUGE_PAGE=2 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_N_WEIGHT_BUFFERS=2 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_BLOCKS=17 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_KV_FULL_BLOCK_ONLY=1 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_DUMP_GEN=/tmp/tiered-offline-8b-all-on \\\nLD_PRELOAD=/root/projects/tiered-serve/etc/stack_pool.so \\\nnumactl -m 0 ./.venv/bin/python offline_offload_kvweight.py \\\n  --model meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct \\\n  --dtype bfloat16 \\\n  --tensor-parallel-size 1 \\\n  --block-size 16 \\\n  --no-enable-prefix-caching \\\n  --batch 1 \\\n  --gen 2 \\\n  --fixed-generation-length \\\n  --prompt-file benchmarks/staged_correctness_prompt.txt \\\n  --expect-text Paris \\\n  --num-gpu-blocks-override 1025 \\\n  --time-breakdown \\\n  --weight-comp p4flat \\\n  --fused-mm \\\n  --kv-comp p4flat \\\n  --ts-configs all-offload-compressed-p4\n```\n\n### 2.2 70B\n\n```bash\nTIERED_SERVE_NUM_WEIGHT_HUGE_PAGE=14 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_N_WEIGHT_BUFFERS=2 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_BLOCKS=17 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_KV_FULL_BLOCK_ONLY=1 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_DUMP_GEN=/tmp/tiered-offline-70b-all-on \\\nLD_PRELOAD=/root/projects/tiered-serve/etc/stack_pool.so \\\nnumactl -m 0 ./.venv/bin/python offline_offload_kvweight.py \\\n  --model meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct \\\n  --dtype bfloat16 \\\n  --tensor-parallel-size 1 \\\n  --block-size 16 \\\n  --no-enable-prefix-caching \\\n  --batch 1 \\\n  --gen 2 \\\n  --fixed-generation-length \\\n  --prompt-file benchmarks/staged_correctness_prompt.txt \\\n  --expect-text Paris \\\n  --num-gpu-blocks-override 1025 \\\n  --time-breakdown \\\n  --weight-comp p4flat \\\n  --fused-mm \\\n  --kv-comp p4flat \\\n  --ts-configs flexgen-comp-p4\n```\n\n두 명령은 weight offload, KV offload, weight compression, KV compression을\n모두 사용한다. P4Flat `offload_compressed` weight는 현재 dense\ndecompress+matmul을 사용하며, log의 explicit fallback marker와\n`WDecomp>0`이 기대값이다. `--fused-mm` 요청 자체는 startup marker로\n확인한다.\n\n## 3. Fused-MM override를 직접 확인\n\nP4Flat fused override 자체를 확인하려면 compressed weight를 지원되는\nresidency에 둔다. KV는 HBM에 고정해 weight route만 분리한다.\n\n```bash\nTIERED_SERVE_NUM_WEIGHT_HUGE_PAGE=2 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_N_WEIGHT_BUFFERS=2 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_DUMP_GEN=/tmp/tiered-offline-8b-fused \\\nLD_PRELOAD=/root/projects/tiered-serve/etc/stack_pool.so \\\nnumactl -m 0 ./.venv/bin/python offline_offload_kvweight.py \\\n  --model meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct \\\n  --dtype bfloat16 \\\n  --tensor-parallel-size 1 \\\n  --block-size 16 \\\n  --no-enable-prefix-caching \\\n  --batch 1 \\\n  --gen 2 \\\n  --fixed-generation-length \\\n  --prompt-file benchmarks/staged_correctness_prompt.txt \\\n  --expect-text Paris \\\n  --num-gpu-blocks-override 1024 \\\n  --time-breakdown \\\n  --weight-comp p4flat \\\n  --fused-mm \\\n  --ts-configs all-frozen-compressed-p4 \\\n  --no-offload-kv\n```\n\n70B에서는 같은 명령의 모델, page 수와 config를 다음처럼 바꾼다.\n\n| 항목 | 8B | 70B |\n|---|---|---|\n| `--model` | `meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct` | `meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct` |\n| `TIERED_SERVE_NUM_WEIGHT_HUGE_PAGE` | `2` | `14` |\n| `--ts-configs` | `all-frozen-compressed-p4` | `all-frozen-split-p4` |\n| `TIERED_SERVE_DUMP_GEN` | `/tmp/tiered-offline-8b-fused` | `/tmp/tiered-offline-70b-fused` |\n\n같은 config를 `--fused-mm` 없이 별도 fresh process로 실행하고 dump prefix를\n`*-dense`로 바꾼 뒤 token도 비교한다.\n\n```bash\ncmp /tmp/tiered-offline-8b-dense.b1.json \\\n    /tmp/tiered-offline-8b-fused.b1.json\ncmp /tmp/tiered-offline-70b-dense.b1.json \\\n    /tmp/tiered-offline-70b-fused.b1.json\n```\n\n합격 기준은 두 run의 `[semantic-answer] PASS`, token equality와 fused run의\n`fused_mm: installed forward override` marker다. 위 batch-1 P4Flat 두\nprofile에서는 decode `WDecomp=0`도 기대한다.\n\n## 4. 출력과 성능 실행\n\n기본 출력은 다음 위치에 생성된다.\n\n```text\nlogs/offline/<model-id>/<config>/<timestamp>/\n├── PCIe_<batch>.log\n├── <timestamp>_<config>.csv\n└── breakdown.csv              # --time-breakdown 사용 시\n\n/tmp/tiered-offline-*.b1.json  # TIERED_SERVE_DUMP_GEN 사용 시\n```\n\n`--time-breakdown`은 H2D timing path에 serialization과 CUDA-event overhead를\n추가하므로 성능 자료로 사용하지 않는다. Correctness가 통과한 뒤 같은 명령에서\n`--gen 2 --time-breakdown`을 `--gen 129 --warmup 16`으로 바꾸고 fresh\nprocess로 최소 3회 반복한다. 모델, prompt, batch, KV topology와 config는\n비교하는 run 사이에 고정한다.\n\n주요 feature gate는 다음과 같다.\n\n| 목적 | 설정 |\n|---|---|\n| Config | `--ts-configs YAML`; 여러 값은 같은 engine에서 순차 적용 |\n| Workload | `--batch`, `--gen`, `--warmup`, `--fixed-generation-length` |\n| Semantic oracle | `--prompt-file FILE --expect-text TEXT` |\n| KV capacity | `--num-gpu-blocks-override N` |\n| Weight offload | `--ts-configs` YAML의 `offload_*` residency |\n| KV offload OFF | `--no-offload-kv` |\n| Weight compression | compressed residency + `--weight-comp BACKEND` |\n| KV compression | KV offload 유지 + `--kv-comp BACKEND` |\n| Fused-MM 요청 | `--fused-mm`; weight compression을 자동으로 켜지 않음 |\n| Route 계측 | `--time-breakdown`; normal latency run에는 사용하지 않음 |\n\n### offline_head\n\"\"\"Offline weight/KV offload benchmark. Run with ``--help`` for options.\"\"\"\n\nimport argparse\nfrom datetime import datetime\nimport logging\nimport os\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\n# Let checkpoint loading and setup use the CPUs available to this process.\n# DualMemoryLoader.init_workers() switches the main ATen team to\n# TIERED_SERVE_MAIN_OMP_THREADS (default 1) before measured inference begins;\n# CPU KV encoders configure their own dedicated team independently.  Do not\n# inherit a stale generic OMP_NUM_THREADS for either phase.\n_startup_omp_default = len(os.sched_getaffinity(0))\n_startup_omp_threads = max(1, int(os.getenv(\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_STARTUP_OMP_THREADS\", str(_startup_omp_default))))\nos.environ[\"OMP_NUM_THREADS\"] = str(_startup_omp_threads)\nos.environ[\"TIERED_SERVE_OMP_PHASE_SWITCH\"] = \"1\"\n\n# Hugepage discovery must happen before importing torch/vLLM/tiered-serve.\nos.environ[\"TIERED_SERVE_NUM_HUGE_PAGE\"] = \"0\"\n_HUGEPAGE_NR_PATH = \"/sys/kernel/mm/hugepages/hugepages-16777216kB/nr_hugepages\"\ntry:\n    with open(_HUGEPAGE_NR_PATH, \"r\") as f:\n        os.environ[\"TIERED_SERVE_NUM_HUGE_PAGE\"] = str(int(f.read().strip()))\nexcept FileNotFoundError:\n    raise RuntimeError(\n        f\"16 GiB hugepages not configured. Expected file: {_HUGEPAGE_NR_PATH}\\n\"\n        f\"Reserve hugepages first, e.g.:\\n\"\n        f\"  echo 16 | sudo tee {_HUGEPAGE_NR_PATH}\\n\"\n        f\"  mkdir -p /mnt/hugepages\\n\"\n        f\"  sudo mount -t hugetlbfs -o pagesize=16G none /mnt/hugepages\")\n\nimport random\nimport sys\nimport time\n\nimport numpy as np\nimport torch\nimport torch.multiprocessing as mp\n\nfrom tiered_serve.immigrant_model_loader import ImmigrantModelLoader  # noqa: F401\nfrom tiered_serve.dual_memory_loader import DualMemoryLoader\nfrom tiered_serve.module_block import resolve_ts_config\n\nfrom vllm import EngineArgs, LLMEngine, SamplingParams\nfrom vllm.utils.argparse_utils import FlexibleArgumentParser\n\nfrom _offline_staged_correctness import (\n    SemanticPromptError,\n    dump_generated_tokens,\n    load_semantic_prompt,\n    validate_semantic_answers,\n    verify_llama_31_70b_runtime_state,\n)\n\n\ndef calc_prefill_phases(batch, input_seq_len, max_num_batched_tokens):\n    \"\"\"Simulate V1 chunked-prefill scheduler to find which phase each\n    request completes its prefill.  V1 processes partial prefill chunks\n    within the token budget, so requests may complete earlier than a\n    naive whole-prefill-only simulation predicts.\n\n    Returns a list of length *batch* where entry *i* is the phase in which\n    request *i* produces its first decode token.\"\"\"\n    prefill_phases = [None] * batch\n    decode_count = 0\n    partials = []          # [(req_index, remaining_tokens)]\n    next_req = 0\n    phase = 0\n\n    while next_req < batch or partials:\n        budget = max_num_batched_tokens\n\n        # 1. Running decode requests consume 1 token each.\n        budget -= decode_count\n\n        # 2. Continue partially-prefilled requests (they are in \"running\"\n        #    and their remaining prompt tokens count toward the budget).\n        new_partials = []\n        for req_idx, remaining in partials:\n            if budget <= 0:\n                new_partials.append((req_idx, remaining))\n                continue\n            consume = min(remaining, budget)\n            budget -= consume\n            remaining -= consume\n            if remaining == 0:\n                prefill_phases[req_idx] = phase\n                decode_count += 1\n            else:\n                new_partials.append((req_idx, remaining))\n        partials = new_partials\n\n        # 3. Schedule new waiting requests with remaining budget.\n        while next_req < batch and budget > 0:\n            consume = min(input_seq_len, budget)\n            budget -= consume\n            remaining = input_seq_len - consume\n            if remaining == 0:\n                prefill_phases[next_req] = phase\n                decode_count += 1\n            else:\n                partials.append((next_req, remaining))\n            next_req += 1\n\n        phase += 1\n\n    return prefill_phases\n\n\ndef main():\n    mp.set_start_method(\"spawn\", force=True)\n\n    seed = 2025010215\n\n    random.seed(seed)\n    np.random.seed(seed)\n    torch.manual_seed(seed)\n    if torch.cuda.is_available():\n        torch.cuda.manual_seed_all(seed)\n\n    parser = FlexibleArgumentParser(\n        description=\"Demo on using the LLMEngine class directly\")\n\n    parser = EngineArgs.add_cli_args(parser)\n    parser.add_argument(\"--batch\", type=int, nargs='+', default=[16], help=\"Batch Size(s) to test sequentially\")\n    parser.add_argument(\"--inputseqlen\",\n                        type=int,\n                        default=1020,\n                        help=\"Input sequence length\")\n    parser.add_argument(\n        \"--prompt-file\",\n        type=Path,\n        default=None,\n        help=\"Optional UTF-8 user prompt for semantic correctness checks. \"\n             \"The prompt is formatted with the model chat template and \"\n             \"replaces the seeded random token input.\")\n    parser.add_argument(\n        \"--expect-text\",\n        default=None,\n        help=\"Case-insensitive substring required in every generated answer. \"\n             \"Requires --prompt-file.\")\n    parser.add_argument(\n        \"--verify-runtime-weights\",\n        action=\"store_true\",\n        help=\"For the Llama-3.1-70B TP=1 staged check, compare sampled \"\n             \"runtime/packed weights with the local safetensors checkpoint \"\n             \"before generating.\")\n    parser.add_argument(\"--gen\", type=int, default=129, help=\"Generate tokens\")\n    parser.add_argument(\n        \"--fixed-generation-length\",\n        action=\"store_true\",\n        help=\"Generate exactly --gen tokens for every request, including with \"\n             \"chunked prefill.  The default preserves the historical \"\n             \"phase-synchronised schedule where requests that finish prefill \"\n             \"earlier generate additional tokens so the batch finishes \"\n             \"together.\")\n    parser.add_argument(\"--prefill-chunk\", type=int, default=8192,\n                        help=\"chunked-prefill chunk size (max_num_batched_\"\n                             \"tokens). Lower it (e.g. 2048) to cap the prefill \"\n                             \"activation peak when frozen weights leave little \"\n                             \"HBM headroom; affects TTFT only, not decode TPOT.\")\n    parser.add_argument(\"--warmup\", type=int, default=0,\n                        help=\"drop the first N decode (TPOT) steps from the \"\n                             \"TTFT/TPOT stats — they run cold (weight-prefetch \"\n                             \"pipeline still filling, KV warming) and inflate \"\n                             \"the mean/P99 tail.\")\n    parser.add_argument(\"-d\",\n                        \"--debug\",\n                        action=\"store_true\",\n                        help=\"Active Debug Log Level(+ nvtx)\")\n    _COMP_CHOICES = [\"zipserv\", \"dietgpu\",\n                     \"zipserv_bf16\", \"dietgpu_bf16\",\n                     \"zipserv_fp8\", \"dietgpu_fp8\",\n                     \"p4flat\", \"p4d16\", \"p3flat_fp8\",\n                     \"ublb_flat\"]\n    parser.add_argument(\"--weight-comp\",\n                        nargs=\"?\",\n                        const=\"zipserv\",\n                        default=None,\n                        choices=_COMP_CHOICES,\n                        help=\"Enable Weight Compression. Optional value \"\n                             \"selects backend (default: zipserv = auto \"\n                             \"BF16/FP8 based on weight dtype). Use the \"\n                             \"_bf16/_fp8 suffix to pin a specific variant.\")\n    parser.add_argument(\"--split-compressor\",\n                        default=None,\n                        choices=_COMP_CHOICES,\n                        help=\"Override compressor backend for the \"\n                             \"frozen_split residency mode only. Falls back \"\n                             \"to --weight-comp if not set.\")\n    parser.add_argument(\"--offload-compressor\",\n                        default=None,\n                        choices=_COMP_CHOICES,\n                        help=\"Override compressor backend for the \"\n                             \"offload_compressed and frozen_compressed \"\n                             \"residency modes. Falls back to --weight-comp \"\n                             \"if not set. Use together with --split-compressor \"\n                             \"to mix backends across modes