RVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_OUTPUT=\"$PWD/benchmark_results/feature_matrix\" \\\n  LD_PRELOAD=/root/projects/tiered-serve/etc/stack_pool.so \\\n  ./.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q -s tests/test_feature_matrix_e2e.py\n```\n\n`TIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_CASES`로 다른 subset도 선택할 수 있다.\nExact-token mode에서는 canonical baseline을 반드시 포함해야 한다.\n\n- 8B baseline: `wo0-ko0-wc0-kc0`\n- 70B baseline: `wo1-ko0-wc0-kc0`\n\n## 5. 옵션과 결과\n\n| 환경변수 | 의미 |\n|---|---|\n| `TIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_OUTPUT` | log/token/summary 출력 루트 |\n| `TIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_CASES` | comma-separated case ID filter |\n| `TIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_REQUIRE_EXACT_TOKENS=1` | baseline과 token IDs까지 동일해야 통과 |\n| `TIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_TIMEOUT` | cell별 timeout, 기본 1800초 |\n| `TIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_NUMACTL=0` | 자동 `numactl -m 0` 사용 중지 |\n| `TIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_WEIGHT_HUGE_PAGES` | 기본 8B=2, 70B=14 override |\n\n출력 구조:\n\n```text\n$OUTPUT/<model>/\n├── feature_matrix.summary.json\n├── <case-id>.log\n└── tokens.<case-id>.b1.json\n```\n\n각 valid cell은 다음을 검사한다.\n\n1. `[semantic-answer] PASS`와 generated-token artifact\n2. `qkv`, `o`, `gate_up`, `down` residency가 요청한 weight state와 일치\n3. Weight/KV compressor와 full-block marker의 ON/OFF 일치\n4. Fused-MM 요청 marker와 예상 override/dense-fallback 개수\n5. Decode `WLoad`, `KVLoad`, `WDecomp`, `KVDecomp`의 기대값\n6. Exact-token mode에서 canonical baseline과 token IDs 일치\n\nFused-MM log contract와 현재 batch-1 P4Flat 기대 count는 다음과 같다.\n\n| 구분 | Marker | 8B | 70B |\n|---|---|---:|---:|\n| 요청 | `##### Using Fused MM` | 모든 cell에 1 | 모든 cell에 1 |\n| `frozen_compressed` override | `fused_mm: installed forward override` | 128 | 해당 없음 |\n| `offload_compressed` fallback | `fused_mm: offload fused unsupported for per-threshold codec P4FlatCompressor` | 128 | 160 |\n\nCount는 해당 weight state를 쓰는 cell에서의 값이며 KV state가 바뀌어도\n같다. Raw-weight cell은 override와 fallback 모두 0이다.\n\n현재 batch-1 P4Flat matrix의 route 기대값은 다음과 같다.\n\n| 기능 | OFF | ON |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| Weight offload | `WLoad=0` | `WLoad>0` |\n| KV offload | `KVLoad=0` | `KVLoad>0` |\n| Weight compression | `WDecomp=0` | fused override이면 `WDecomp=0`, dense fallback이면 `WDecomp>0` |\n| KV compression | `KVDecomp=0` | `KVDecomp>0` |\n\n`O>0`은 offload capacity만 뜻한다. KV 검증에는 요청이 실제 offloadable\nblock을 사용하고 `KVLoad>0`이어야 한다.\n\n## 6. 검증 범위\n\n이 matrix는 correctness와 route smoke다.\n\n- `--time-breakdown`이 켜진 계측 실행이므로 성능 비교 자료가 아니다.\n- Exact-token 검사는 한 matrix 실행 안의 cell 간 비교다. Race 검증에는\n  matrix 자체를 여러 번 실행해 artifact를 비교해야 한다.\n- 70B에서는 weight-offload OFF 여섯 valid cell을 검증하지 않는다.\n- Fused-MM은 고정 ON이며 별도 ON/OFF 축은 아니다. 현재 P4Flat\n  `offload_compressed` cell은 명시적인 dense fallback을 사용하므로 70B\n  matrix는 fused request와 fallback을 검증한다.\n- ATS와 `--reduce-kv-footprint`는 별도 실험이므로 matrix에서 제외한다.\n- Mixed-prefill은 기본적으로 raw secondary KV를 읽을 수 있다.\n  `vllm_offload_kvweight_prefill.py`는 해당 phase와 active-block 진단용이며\n  기본 answer matrix를 대신하지 않는다.\n\n성능은 correctness 통과 후 동일한 topology로 별도 normal pass를 최소\n3회 실행한다. 예를 들어 생성 길이를 `--gen 129 --warmup 16`으로 늘리고\nnormal pass에는 `--time-breakdown`을 사용하지 않는다. 원인 분석이 필요할\n때만 같은 조건의 별도 instrumentation pass를 추가한다.\n\n### feature_matrix\n\"\"\"Semantic E2E matrix for the four tiered-serving feature switches.\n\nThe valid runtime state space contains twelve answer-producing cells:\n\n* weight placement/representation has four states\n  (frozen/offloaded x uncompressed/compressed), and\n* KV placement/representation has three states\n  (HBM resident, raw offloaded, compressed offloaded).\n\n``KV offload=OFF, KV compression=ON`` is not a fourth KV state: the runtime\ncannot persist compressed KV without an offloadable tier.  Those four Boolean\nrows are unsupported and are kept visible as negative matrix entries.\n\nThe full matrix uses Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct because a BF16 70B model cannot fit\nthe true weight-offload-OFF cells in one 96 GiB GH200.  A 70B profile still\nexecutes the six supported weight-offload-ON cells using the placement-matched\n``flexgen`` pair.  The E2E is opt-in because every cell starts a fresh process:\n\n    TIERED_SERVE_RUN_FEATURE_MATRIX_E2E=1 \\\n      ./.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q -s tests/test_feature_matrix_e2e.py\n\n    TIERED_SERVE_RUN_FEATURE_MATRIX_E2E=1 \\\n    TIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_MODEL=meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct \\\n      ./.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q -s tests/test_feature_matrix_e2e.py\n\nEach process reuses ``offline_offload_kvweight.py``'s semantic oracle, writes a\ngenerated-token dump, proves the requested route was active from runtime logs,\nand records whether its token IDs match the canonical raw baseline.  Set\n``TIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_REQUIRE_EXACT_TOKENS=1`` to promote that stronger\ndeterminism check to a test requirement.\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nfrom dataclasses import asdict, dataclass\nimport hashlib\nimport itertools\nimport json\nimport os\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport re\nimport shlex\nimport shutil\nimport subprocess\n\nimport pytest\nimport yaml\n\n\nREPO_ROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]\nPYTHON = REPO_ROOT / \".venv\" / \"bin\" / \"python\"\nDRIVER = REPO_ROOT / \"offline_offload_kvweight.py\"\nPROMPT = REPO_ROOT / \"benchmarks\" / \"staged_correctness_prompt.txt\"\nMODEL_8B = \"meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct\"\nMODEL_70B = \"meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct\"\nDEFAULT_MODEL = MODEL_8B\nEXPECTED_TEXT = \"Paris\"\nCOMPONENTS = (\"qkv\", \"o\", \"gate_up\", \"down\")\n\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass FeatureCase:\n    weight_offload: bool\n    kv_offload: bool\n    weight_comp: bool\n    kv_comp: bool\n\n    @property\n    def case_id(self) -> str:\n        return (\n            f\"wo{int(self.weight_offload)}-ko{int(self.kv_offload)}-\"\n            f\"wc{int(self.weight_comp)}-kc{int(self.kv_comp)}\"\n        )\n\n    @property\n    def answer_supported(self) -> bool:\n        return self.kv_offload or not self.kv_comp\n\n    @property\n    def weight_mode(self) -> str:\n        if self.weight_offload:\n            return (\n                \"offload_compressed\"\n                if self.weight_comp else \"offload_uncompressed\"\n            )\n        return (\n            \"frozen_compressed\"\n            if self.weight_comp else \"frozen_uncompressed\"\n        )\n\n    @property\n    def weight_config(self) -> str:\n        \"\"\"Pure-placement config used by the full 8B matrix.\"\"\"\n        return {\n            (False, False): \"all-frozen-uncompressed\",\n            (False, True): \"all-frozen-compressed-p4\",\n            (True, False): \"all-streamed-uncompressed\",\n            (True, True): \"all-offload-compressed-p4\",\n        }[(self.weight_offload, self.weight_comp)]\n\n\nALL_CASES = tuple(\n    FeatureCase(*values)\n    for values in itertools.product((False, True), repeat=4)\n)\nANSWER_CASES = tuple(case for case in ALL_CASES if case.answer_supported)\nUNSUPPORTED_CASES = tuple(\n    case for case in ALL_CASES if not case.answer_supported)\n\n\ndef _model_name(model: str) -> str:\n    return model.rstrip(\"/\").split(\"/\")[-1]\n\n\ndef _answer_cases_for_model(model: str) -> tuple[FeatureCase, ...]:\n    model_name = _model_name(model)\n    if model_name == \"Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct\":\n        return ANSWER_CASES\n    if model_name == \"Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct\":\n        return tuple(case for case in ANSWER_CASES if case.weight_offload)\n    raise ValueError(\n        \"feature matrix supports only Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct and \"\n        f\"Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct; got {model!r}\")\n\n\ndef _weight_config(case: FeatureCase, model: str) -> str:\n    if _model_name(model) == \"Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct\":\n        if not case.weight_offload:\n            raise ValueError(\n                f\"{case.case_id}: 70B requires weight offloading\")\n        return \"flexgen-comp-p4\" if case.weight_comp else \"flexgen\"\n    return case.weight_config\n\n\ndef _expected_residency(\n    case: FeatureCase,\n    model: str,\n) -> dict[str, int]:\n    if _model_name(model) == \"Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct\":\n        return {\n            \"frozen_uncompressed\": 40,\n            case.weight_mode: 40,\n        }\n    return {case.weight_mode: 32}\n\n\ndef _canonical_baseline_id(model: str) -> str:\n    return (\n        \"wo1-ko0-wc0-kc0\"\n        if _model_name(model) == \"Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct\"\n        else \"wo0-ko0-wc0-kc0\"\n    )\n\n\n_MATRIX_ENV_TO_CLEAR = (\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_ATS_DECOMP_FROZEN\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_ATS_DECOMP_OFFLOAD\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_BLOCKS\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_SIZE_GB\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_GPU_RESERVE_GIB\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_KV_ADDR_ORDER\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_KV_BLOB_SLACK\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_KV_BLOB_STRIDE\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_KV_COMP_BACKEND\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_KV_COMP_PREFILL_LOAD\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_KV_COMP_PRODUCER\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_KV_DECODE_LOAD\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_KV_DOUBLE_BUFFER\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_KV_DRAIN_OFFLOAD\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_KV_FULL_BLOCK_ONLY\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_KV_H2D_ON_WEIGHT\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_KV_LOCALITY\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_KV_PREFILL_JIT_CURRENT\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_KV_RANDOM_ALLOC\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_MANTEXP_SPLIT\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_MANTEXP_SPLIT_KV\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_MANTEXP_SPLIT_WEIGHT\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_N_WEIGHT_BUFFERS\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_OFFLOAD_COMP_BACKEND\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_OFFLOAD_PREFILL_MAX_CHUNK\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_PREFILL_ALT_BACKEND\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_PREFILL_ALT_MAX_CHUNK\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_PREFILL_RAW_BF16\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_RAW_KV_ALIAS\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_SPLIT_COMP_BACKEND\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_USE_FUSED_MM\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_WEIGHT_COMP_BACKEND\",\n)\n\n\ndef _config_path(model: str, config: str) -> Path:\n    model_dir = model.rstrip(\"/\").split(\"/\")[-1]\n    return (\n        REPO_ROOT / \"tiered_serve\" / \"model_configs\" / \"meta-llama\" /\n        model_dir / f\"{config}.yaml\"\n    )\n\n\ndef _driver_command(case: FeatureCase, model: str) -> list[str]:\n    if not case.answer_supported:\n        raise ValueError(\n            f\"{case.case_id}: KV compression requires KV offloading\")\n\n    physical_blocks = 1025 if case.kv_comp else 1024\n    command = [\n        str(PYTHON),\n        str(DRIVER),\n        \"--model\", model,\n        \"--dtype\", \"bfloat16\",\n        \"--tensor-parallel-size\", \"1\",\n        \"--block-size\", \"16\",\n        \"--no-enable-prefix-caching\",\n        \"--batch\", \"1\",\n        \"--fixed-generation-length\",\n        \"--prompt-file\", str(PROMPT),\n        \"--expect-text\", EXPECTED_TEXT,\n        \"--gen\", \"2\",\n        \"--time-breakdown\",\n        \"--num-gpu-blocks-override\", str(physical_blocks),\n        \"--ts-configs\", str(_config_path(\n            model, _weight_config(case, model))),\n    ]\n    if case.weight_comp:\n        command.extend((\"--weight-comp\", \"p4flat\"))\n    if case.kv_comp:\n        command.extend((\"--kv-comp\", \"p4flat\"))\n    if not case.kv_offload:\n        command.append(\"--no-offload-kv\")\n    return command\n\n\ndef _case_environment(\n    case: FeatureCase,\n    dump_prefix: Path,\n    model: str,\n) -> dict[str, str]:\n    env = os.environ.copy()\n    for name in _MATRIX_ENV_TO_CLEAR:\n        env.pop(name, None)\n\n    env.update({\n        \"PYTHONHASHSEED\": \"0\",\n        \"TIERED_SERVE_DUMP_GEN\": str(dump_prefix),\n        # Do not inherit a stale setting from another model profile.  8B uses\n        # two 16 GiB pages; the established 70B flexgen path uses fourteen.\n        \"TIERED_SERVE_NUM_WEIGHT_HUGE_PAGE\": os.environ.get(\n            \"TIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_WEIGHT_HUGE_PAGES\",\n            \"14\" if _model_name(model) == \"Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct\" else \"2\",\n        ),\n        \"TIERED_SERVE_N_WEIGHT_BUFFERS\": \"2\",\n    })\n    if case.kv_offload:\n        # Full-block KV compression reserves one request-private tail row for\n        # batch 1.  The scheduler-visible logical boundary remains D=16.\n        env[\"TIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_BLOCKS\"] = (\n            \"17\" if case.kv_comp else \"16\")\n        env[\"TIERED_SERVE_KV_FULL_BLOCK_ONLY\"] = (\n            \"1\" if case.kv_comp else \"0\")\n    return env\n\n\ndef _parse_residency(log_text: str) -> dict[str, dict[str, int]]:\n    result: dict[str, dict[str, int]] = {}\n    pattern = re.compile(\n        r\"layer_residency resolved .*?\"\n        r\"(qkv|o|gate_up|down): \\{([^}]*)\\}\")\n    for match in pattern.finditer(log_text):\n        result[match.group(1)] = {\n            mode: int(count)\n            for mode, count in re.findall(\n                r\"([a-z_]+):\\s*(\\d+)\", match.group(2))\n        }\n    return result\n\n\ndef _parse_decode_breakdown(log_text: str) -> dict[str, float]:\n    matches = re.findall(\n        r\"D \\[Breakdown\\].*?WDecomp: ([0-9.]+) \"\n        r\"KVDecomp: ([0-9.]+) WLoad: ([0-9.]+) \"\n        r\"KVLoad: ([0-9.]+)\",\n        log_text,\n    )\n    assert matches, \"missing decode timing breakdown\"\n    wdecomp, kvdecomp, wload, kvload = matches[-1]\n    return {\n        \"wdecomp\": float(wdecomp),\n        \"kvdecomp\": float(kvdecomp),\n        \"wload\": float(wload),\n        \"kvload\": float(kvload),\n    }\n\n\ndef _assert_activity(case: FeatureCase, log_text: str) -> None:\n    breakdown = _parse_decode_breakdown(log_text)\n    expected = {\n        \"wdecomp\": case.weight_comp,\n        \"kvdecomp\": case.kv_comp,\n        \"wload\": case.weight_offload,\n        \"kvload\": case.kv_offload,\n    }\n    for metric, should_be_active in expected.items():\n        value = breakdown[metric]\n        if should_be_active:\n            assert value > 0.0, (\n                f\"{case.case_id}: expected active {metric}, got {value}\")\n        else:\n            assert value <= 0.0001, (\n                f\"{case.case_id}: expected inactive {metric}, got {value}\")\n\n\ndef _assert_route(case: FeatureCase, log_text: str, model: str) -> None:\n    residency = _parse_residency(log_text)\n    expected_residency = _expected_residency(case, model)\n    for component in COMPONENTS:\n        assert component in residency, (\n            f\"{case.case_id}: missing {component} residency summary\")\n        assert residency[component] == expected_residency, (\n            f\"{case.case_id}: expected {component}={expected_residency}, \"\n            f\"got {residency[component]}\")\n\n    weight_marker = \"##### Using Weight Compression\" in log_text\n    assert weight_marker is case.weight_comp, (\n        f\"{case.case_id}: weight-compression marker={weight_marker}\")\n\n    preloaded = \"Preload layer \" in log_text\n    assert preloaded is case.weight_offload, (\n        f\"{case.case_id}: streamed-weight preload marker={preloaded}\")\n\n    kv_marker = \"##### Using KV Compression\" in log_text\n    assert kv_marker is case.kv_comp, (\n        f\"{case.case_id}: KV-compression marker={kv_marker}\")\n    p4flat_instance = \"KV compressor: P4Flat (\" in log_text\n    assert p4flat_instance is case.kv_comp, (\n        f\"{case.case_id}: P4Flat compressor instance={p4flat_instance}\")\n    full_block_marker = \"[kv-full-block] ENABLED backend=p4flat\" in log_text\n    assert full_block_marker is case.kv_comp, (\n        f\"{case.case_id}: full-block marker={full_block_marker}\")\n    tail_topology = (\n        \"[kv-full-block] tail residency configured: \"\n        \"max_num_reqs=1 D=16 S=1 physical_buffer_offset=17\"\n    ) in log_text\n    assert tail_topology is case.kv_comp, (\n        f\"{case.case_id}: full-block tail topology={tail_topology}\")\n    compressed_decode = \"KV decode load backend: compressed\" in log_text\n    assert compressed_decode is case.kv_comp, (\n        f\"{case.case_id}: compressed KV decode route={compressed_decode}\")\n\n    # The raw route can use the direct batched-copy path, which does not emit\n    # kv_offload_system.py's sampled [kv-load]/[kv-unload] warnings.  The\n    # decode CUDA-event breakdown below is the source of truth: KVLoad must be\n    # positive exactly when KV offload is active, while KVDecomp distinguishes\n    # raw from compressed restore.\n    _assert_activity(case, log_text)\n\n\ndef _read_tokens(case: FeatureCase, dump_prefix: Path) -> list[list[int]]:\n    token_path = Path(f\"{dump_prefix}.b1.json\")\n    assert token_path.is_file(), (\n        f\"{case.case_id}: missing generated-token dump {token_path}\")\n    tokens = json.loads(token_path.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n    assert isinstance(tokens, list) and len(tokens) == 1\n    assert isinstance(tokens[0], list) and tokens[0]\n    assert all(isinstance(token, int) for token in tokens[0])\n    return tokens\n\n\ndef _selected_answer_cases(model: str) -> tuple[FeatureCase, ...]:\n    model_cases = _answer_cases_for_model(model)\n    requested = os.getenv(\"TIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_CASES\")\n    if not requested:\n        return model_cases\n    requested_ids = {value.strip() for value in requested.split(\",\") if value}\n    known_ids = {case.case_id for case in model_cases}\n    unknown = requested_ids - known_ids\n    if unknown:\n        raise ValueError(f\"unknown feature-matrix cases: {sorted(unknown)}\")\n    return tuple(case for case in model_cases\n                 if case.case_id in requested_ids)\n\n\ndef test_feature_matrix_definition() -> None:\n    assert len(ALL_CASES) == 16\n    assert len(ANSWER_CASES) == 12\n    assert len(UNSUPPORTED_CASES) == 4\n    assert all(not case.kv_offload and case.kv_comp\n               for case in UNSUPPORTED_CASES)\n\n    assert len(_answer_cases_for_model(MODEL_70B)) == 6\n\n    for model in (MODEL_8B, MODEL_70B):\n        for case in _answer_cases_for_model(model):\n            config = _config_path(model, _weight_config(case, model))\n            assert config.is_file(), f\"missing matrix config: {config}\"\n            config_data = yaml.safe_load(config.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n            default_residency = config_data[\"layer_residency\"][\"default\"]\n            for component in COMPONENTS:\n                cell = default_residency[component]\n                mode = cell[\"mode\"] if isinstance(cell, dict) else cell\n                compressor = (\n                    cell.get(\"compressor\")\n                    if isinstance(cell, dict) else None\n                )\n                assert mode == case.weight_mode\n                assert (compressor == \"p4flat\") is case.weight_comp\n            if _model_name(model) == \"Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct\":\n                frozen_default = config_data[\"layer_residency\"][\n                    \"frozen\"][\"_default\"]\n                assert frozen_default == {\n                    \"mode\": \"frozen_uncompressed\",\n                    \"layers\": \"even\",\n                }\n            command = _driver_command(case, model)\n            assert (\"--weight-comp\" in command) is case.weight_comp\n            assert (\"--kv-comp\" in command) is case.kv_comp\n            assert (\"--no-offload-kv\" in command) is (not case.kv_offload)\n\n    for case in UNSUPPORTED_CASES:\n        with pytest.raises(ValueError, match=\"requires KV offloading\"):\n            _driver_command(case, DEFAULT_MODEL)\n\n\n### config_files\nbash: line 1: rg: command not found\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a03c9e-6106-7ee1-bc9b-c778074dc1e7","create_time":1787723451.377812}}}
